                    "sense_definition": "An illicit narcotic drug, especially morphine or heroin.",
                    "learner_level": "C2",
                    "frequency": "VeryLow",
                    "semantic_group_id": "narcotics",
                    "name_type": "no",
                    "examples": [
                        {
                            "text": "In the vintage crime novel, the detective searched the suspects for hidden <w>mojo</w>.",
